      "title": "How to use",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Geekatplay Canvas - MiniMax H3 Image (partner API, 2K / 4K)\n\n1. Drop or paste images onto the canvas. **Inside the frame** they are part of the picture, **outside** they are references only.\n2. Draw with the pen (B). Strokes close together become one sketch.\n3. Right-click anywhere (or press N) to pin a note: *girl climbs the tree from this side*, *dress her in this suit*.\n4. Add an overall prompt below the canvas. Mention items as @image1, @sketch1; the canvas turns them into MiniMax's @Image1, @Image2.\n5. Pick the aspect ratio in the canvas toolbar, then Run. The canvas size (MP) only sets the layout guide; the **size** widget on the MiniMax node sets the output.\n\n**Output size:** `4K` (default) or `2K` with aspect ratio `auto` follows the first image, which is the canvas layout. Set a fixed ratio when only shelf references are used. `custom` takes any width x height up to 7680 px (0.65 to 20 MP, at most 3:1).\n\n**Model:** `MiniMax-H3-Image` for best quality, `-Highspeed` for faster drafts. The canvas sends the layout plus up to 7 references; edits always get MiniMax's prompt enhancement, and **revised_prompt** shows what it wrote.\n\nNeeds a Comfy account with credits; the price badge on the node shows the estimate."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Geekatplay Canvas - MiniMax H3 Image (partner API, 2K / 4K)\n\n1. Drop or paste images onto the canvas. **Inside the frame** they are part of the picture, **outside** they are references only.\n2. Draw with the pen (B). Strokes close together become one sketch.\n3. Right-click anywhere (or press N) to pin a note: *girl climbs the tree from this side*, *dress her in this suit*.\n4. Add an overall prompt below the canvas. Mention items as @image1, @sketch1; the canvas turns them into MiniMax's @Image1, @Image2.\n5. Pick the aspect ratio in the canvas toolbar, then Run. The canvas size (MP) only sets the layout guide; the **size** widget on the MiniMax node sets the output.\n\n**Output size:** `4K` (default) or `2K` with aspect ratio `auto` follows the first image, which is the canvas layout. Set a fixed ratio when only shelf references are used. `custom` takes any width x height up to 7680 px (0.65 to 20 MP, at most 3:1).\n\n**Model:** `MiniMax-H3-Image` for best quality, `-Highspeed` for faster drafts. The canvas sends the layout plus up to 7 references; edits always get MiniMax's prompt enhancement, and **revised_prompt** shows what it wrote.\n\nNeeds a Comfy account with credits; the price badge on the node shows the estimate."
      },
